  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 102.23 Best management practices for utility maintenance (Utility BMPs)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 102.23 “Best management practices for utility maintenance (Utility BMPs)” means “Best Management Practices Manual, Utility Maintenance in and Adjacent to Wetlands and Waterbodies in New Hampshire” dated 2019, published by NH DNCR, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; renumbered by #13945 (formerly Env-Wt 102.24)",
